ghostab (3.0.1-alpha) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Built-in update checker: compares against aramcz.is-a.dev/ghostabver.txt
    at launch and from Help, with a Download button that opens the release
    page in your browser.
  * Reworked About dialog with About, Shortcuts, and Credits tabs.

 -- AramCZ <aramcz@protonmail.com>  Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000

ghostab (3.0.0-alpha) unstable; urgency=medium

  * RightDao replaces DuckDuckGo as the default search engine.
  * Browser-style keyboard shortcuts, closed-tab reopening, and Escape to
    cancel a page load.
  * Lists, tables, preformatted blocks, inline emphasis, definition lists,
    and an expanded set of HTML entities.
  * Emoji-aware text shaping with correct Unicode display widths.
  * Loading indicator, realistic request headers, and a persistent cookie jar.

 -- AramCZ <aramcz@protonmail.com>  Mon, 05 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000

